  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that config_001 (multimodal, multiprofile, pca_n2000 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, avgpool, concat) achieves the highest accuracy (0.6287). This experiment tests changing the image encoder to resnet50 and fusion to weighted while keeping RNA encoder and aggregation the same. It isolates the impact of image encoder and fusion method, which are critical design choices with uncertain optimal settings. This balances exploitation (building on the top-performing config) and exploration (testing key components)."
